"""paramspace_mean_coherence.csv | Supplementary Fig. S14 (04_figures/supp_paramspace/figS_paramspace_A4.py)

Recovered statistical-analysis script | reproducibility package | Fig. 3 track.

WHAT THIS SCRIPT COMPUTES
    This code loads a table of coherence results computed over a two-
    dimensional parameter sweep of GABA and AMPA conductance values, then
    reshapes it from long format into a wide matrix using pandas pivot,
    with GABA values as rows and AMPA values as columns and the
    Mean_Coherence measurement filling the cells. The resulting matrix is
    written out as paramspace_mean_coherence.csv. One row of the output
    table corresponds to a single fixed GABA value, showing how the mean
    coherence measure changes across the full range of AMPA values tested
    at that GABA level.

INPUT FILES
    coherence_results_tau_gamma.csv

